  "duration_seconds": 75.0,
  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C01",
      "text": "手电光照在叉车轮子上。一个女人说，停。我抬头，看见她腰侧挂着一根短棍。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "dc555ea2be8c713a71a91c09fdc0deb86e785ba0b6b9a9b4ad4ee14284610b9b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.137,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 185,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f4ae9429ee1b808991e13006f1c45e877e3152a8994ee81c1086db0ec9664136",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "sample_count": 294576
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C02",
      "text": "她站得笔直，右手习惯性贴着腰侧，左耳后有一道浅疤。她说，这批货，没有报备单。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "76a085ce01deb6abfe310deac03304d7029aa24b660f492b84e9aa3ccf3c7c25",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.196104166666666,
      "start_frame": 188,
      "end_frame": 374,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "901b815d0770adc62a0db6929d2a3da52c0040acf04d25da64bd565f7e7c392b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "sample_count": 297413
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C03",
      "text": "我把合同递过去。她看得很慢，没找到破绽，就抽出美工刀，划开一个纸箱，又划开一个。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2298800175bf7dfed78168009617e2521ee32d15376a360cf301901e57f907df",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.601979166666666,
      "start_frame": 377,
      "end_frame": 576,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "72fcf4635ef440be2e2cdc1f28cb3de7929c19a3f40b1d78c00514f0ab31d6e2",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "sample_count": 316895
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C04",
      "text": "柴油，压缩饼干，种子，探照灯。她抬眼看我，说，这些东西放在一起，只有两种人，邪教，和准备打仗的。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0bfd142baad0b59ba181e1821ddb11bf394b0f9ae6759e7d855e3819580c42c3",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.620375,
      "start_frame": 579,
      "end_frame": 838,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "1b7a9bd29713825dd334db58d8631b48f9a6ada107e9fab55a4353f97cd42a0b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "sample_count": 413778
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C05",
      "text": "我说，我是前仓储主管。我囤的不是货，是命。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "42bf97884507f961497f8b0bbdbbe2fbbb4b7e3125acb0a71e6e87e718b508a6",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.9147916666666664,
      "start_frame": 841,
      "end_frame": 959,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "88b595e1e15589448e0358e334846ff68e8a0ee4c9100fa9e51d792609064bf2",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "sample_count": 187910
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C06",
      "text": "她握刀的手，停了半秒。她问，命？我说，三个月后，你就知道我说得对不对。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b4647c4eaa503900ef1fd2e814e035e3f083b2390b5f9c71dae4cc4811904aa8",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.769729166666667,
      "start_frame": 962,
      "end_frame": 1136,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "420f2c9a6f98f4538c10fdf4d9ef5b97b936e04802a3e55db7a790b9c3589911",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "sample_count": 276947
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C07",
      "text": "她冷冷收刀。三个月后我还在这儿当保安。你要是骗我，我查你一辈子。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "6eaa8a0355f94c084e89b49effa1c0fce897bf8b9047b4cada50d1c49fa507e8",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.184645833333334,
      "start_frame": 1139,
      "end_frame": 1295,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "5716b7a563aa7479c7c7916dc0c11adf86e595ae102eac286872c48a4a1ef2f0",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.78025,
      "sample_count": 248863
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C08",
      "text": "补完资料，她在回执上签了名字，夏凛。字迹很重，像刀刻出来的。那时候，距离血月降临，还剩八十五天。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4357882be72ae3de2d2287cbcd03af65e6566043fefb9cfaa3d10ba875effcfa",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.298666666666668,
      "start_frame": 1298,
      "end_frame": 1547,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "b5aaaae5bd5611dfcb074474b50add5927ade081193e6b9cd20a5f7a775a7b14",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "sample_count": 398336
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C09",
      "text": "卸货的时候，她一直站在叉车和人之间。我心想，仓里这么多东西，夜里是该有个这样认真的人。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "61ecdba3c21db54a3ef8b04319b4a796775d41304b8625addbf04afd66c4cfd5",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.627083333333333,
      "start_frame": 1550,
      "end_frame": 1749,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "065b792bef985fa1698a6210daf28f57c976a652ef8ecdfc329b9bbbe7b51a5f",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.6,
      "sample_count": 318100
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C10",
      "text": "凌晨，我去岗亭交副本。她正合上一本旧本子，页面上露出一笔转账，八千。我没问是给谁。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "9cb701cb4204384d48146aab93e2071fe5936a21b5f2137acc54dcda2e683eeb",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "start_frame": 1752,
      "end_frame": 1973,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a6031ff41fe2a23aecd53bcbde40cc4ab79ad325c9dea64b4384e7e5f2003927",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.589844,
      "sample_count": 353280
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C11",
      "text": "她没抬头，把我的报备单压在窗口下，在新的一页，写下一个字。命。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "efba19765215a5cdaea7377bd4fdbdc752918aa801db4e37056a7233bf763273",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.075354166666667,
      "start_frame": 1976,
      "end_frame": 2129,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3dcac072135541c42911e7f5e68e0ff6ba35b763d7de4876bc27d64be1ebd21b",
      "source_duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "sample_count": 243617
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP005-C12",
      "text": "她脖子上挂着一块旧狗牌，握着笔的指节，微微发白。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/speed1p3/EP005-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "3495ef8d8ec276954ea945e1e79bdfb3358cb458636d95ae9fdd9995eab6d728",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.904,
      "start_frame": 2132,
      "end_frame": 2250,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP005/audio/EP005-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f5df40db0d9f0f9bac5a552ab077040e7f0261f4ffa17c573471c3242cf56546",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "sample_count": 187392
    }
  ],
